      "content": "it's not even a crisis, it just feels like... a realization. like if i'm just drifting anyway, why fight the tide? there's something so much more honest about just accepting the drift. like, isn't there a kind of beauty in just stopping the fight and letting the nothingness take over? it feels more natural than this forced existence.",
